Color Names (color-name-list)
  https://github.com/meodai/color-name-list
  The precise color names swatch files and palette files carry: the
  build writes color-name-list's names to /assets/color-names-*.txt
  (apps/web/scripts/color-names.ts). The rows with source "meodai" in
  packages/search/train/data/pairs.json, on which the search models in
  apps/web/public/search are trained, and the color word ranges in
  packages/engine/src/colornames.data.ts, measured from them.
  Copyright (c) 2017 David Aerne
  MIT License, below

c3 color naming data
  https://github.com/StanfordHCI/c3
  The XKCD color survey's answers as c3 holds them. The color names in
  packages/engine/src/colornames.data.ts are derived from them.
  Copyright (c) 2011, Stanford University
  BSD 3-Clause License, below

